{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "That's Christmas To Me feels like a natural next choice because Christmas albums recur throughout my recent listening.",
    "PTXmas fits the holiday vocal music I want and feels connected to my interest in The New Old Fashioned."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "Summer Horns and Amazing 50s Stereo Jukebox offer different themes; simply being music does not connect them closely enough to my Christmas listening.",
    "Stages and Passione give me too little evidence of a holiday connection to choose them, while general duets and artist collections are less compelling right now."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "The recommendations seem to treat an interest in several albums as a broad appetite for unrelated music.",
    "Vocal music alone seems to count too much when the Christmas theme is what makes the strongest choices appealing to me."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "Several Christmas selections close together, including repeated interest in The Classic Christmas Album, make holiday music a stronger clue than a single album choice.",
    "My latest choice, The New Old Fashioned, adds interest in vocal music, but it does not establish that I want every kind of vocal album or that I want Christmas music exclusively."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations recognize my interest in Christmas vocal music, but extend it too broadly to albums with little clear connection to what I have chosen."
}"}
